<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<span id="docs-internal-guid-18364488-c6df-90a9-f078-70612ebecd69"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">{!Contact.FirstName},</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Thank you for your interest in the family and human development PhD program at the T. Denny Sanford School of Social and Family Dynamics. Please review the </span><a href="https://thesanfordschool.asu.edu/sites/default/files/Handbook-FHD-Grad-1-30-2014.pdf" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">program handbook</span></a><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> for information on the admission process, courses offered, plan of study, dissertation details and more.</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Applications for the next academic year are accepted from September 1 to January 15. Application reviews begin in early January. Please visit the </span><a href="https://thesanfordschool.asu.edu/graduate-studies/fhd-phd" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">program's website</span></a><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> for any updates.</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Once you have reviewed the handbook, please email </span><a href="mailto:gina.perez@asu.edu" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">me</span></a><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> with any questions you may have.</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/dgsadmissions/Index.jsp" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Start your application today</span></a></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Thank you and we look forward to hearing from you!</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Gina Perez</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Graduate Programs Coordinator</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">T. Denny Sanford School of Social and Family Dynamics</span></p><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">480-965-6874</span></span>]]></td>
</tr>
